  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef is working with two matrices, `A` and `B`. He is interested in matrix multiplication.\n\nYour task is to help Chef in finding the product of these two matrices.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line contains two integers `n` and `m`, the number of rows and columns in matrix `A`.\nThe next `n` lines each contain `m` space separated integers, representing the elements of matrix `A`.\nThe next line contains two integers `p` and `q`, the number of rows and columns of matrix `B`.\nThe next `p` lines each contain `q` space separated integers, representing the elements of matrix `B`.\n\n\nOutput Format\n\nPrint the product of the two matrices.\nIf the product does not exist print `-1`.",
